[Em]Khoobsurat hai woh [Am]itna,        [D]Saha nahi [Em]jaata
Aankh me [D]kaid kiye [C]baitha,        [C]Mai ek [D]haseen [Em]lamha
jab mai [D]is neend se [C]jagoonga,        To [G]dil tootega
